  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>.</p><p>By the given condition,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;</p><p>The magnitude is given by the formula,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi></msub></msqrt></math><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>33</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></blockquote>",
